#: ../../getting_started/nlte.md:1
msgid "NLTE correction"
msgstr "NLTE 修正"

#: ../../getting_started/nlte.md:3
msgid ""
"The non-Local Thermal Equilibrium (NLTE) correction can be applied to the"
" spectrum by setting the `nlte` attribute of the SME structure, before "
"`synthesize_spectrum` or `solve`:"
msgstr ""
"在调用 `synthesize_spectrum` 或 `solve` 之前，可以先设置 SME 结构中的 `nlte` 属性，从而对光谱应用 "
"NLTE（non-local thermodynamic equilibrium）修正："

#: ../../getting_started/nlte.md:10
msgid "The current elements with NLTE correction includes:"
msgstr "当前支持 NLTE 修正的元素如下："

#: ../../getting_started/nlte.md:12
msgid "![](../_static/nlte_table.png)"
msgstr "![](../_static/nlte_table.png)"

#: ../../getting_started/nlte.md:15
msgid ""
"Long format VALD linelist is required for NLTE calculations. If only a "
"short format has been given, then the calculations will only be in LTE. "
"(See [](../fundamentals/linelist.md))"
msgstr ""
"NLTE 计算需要使用 VALD 的 long format 谱线表。如果给的是 short format，那么程序只会按 LTE 计算。"
"详见 [谱线表](../fundamentals/linelist.md)。"

#: ../../getting_started/nlte.md:17
msgid "The NLTE grids are only compatible with the MARCS model atmosphere."
msgstr "NLTE 网格目前只兼容 MARCS 模型大气。"

#: ../../getting_started/nlte.md:21
msgid ""
"Upon the first use of the NLTE correction, the NLTE grid will be "
"downloaded from the server and this may takes a while, depending on the "
"size of the NLTE grid."
msgstr "第一次使用 NLTE 修正时，程序会从服务器下载对应的 NLTE 网格。具体耗时取决于网格文件大小。"

#: ../../getting_started/nlte.md:24
msgid ""
"Similarly they can be disabled for each element using "
"`sme.nlte.remove_nlte(el)`."
msgstr "如果你想对某个元素关闭 NLTE，也可以使用 `sme.nlte.remove_nlte(el)`。"

#: ../../getting_started/nlte.md:26
msgid ""
"More details on NLTE can be found in the [concept "
"section](../concepts/nlte.md)."
msgstr "更多细节请参考 [concept 部分中的 NLTE 说明](../concepts/nlte.md)。"
